: "My Virtual Pet VR is your in-headset pet.  Do you have what it takes to care for your very own dino pet?  Similar to Tamagotchi in the 90s, My Battle Pet VR is yours to love, care for, play with, and grow.  Win battles with fellow Virtual Pets by keeping your loveable dino happy.  Make sure your dino is eating and sleeping.  Play fetch.  Win special food and energy by interacting with VR brand objects and videos.  Earn your pet\u2019s affection while building it\u2019s happiness.  All for the love of your pet.  And winning battles, of course.", "short_description": "Meet your new virtual pet! This loveable dino is yours to care for and grow."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.immersivemagic.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.immersivemagic.io/tos", "publisher_name": "Immersive Magic", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.immersivemagic.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "202356168734154"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162708_340249619748903_1987838833139384320_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=StZ623SCEOIQ7kNvwFAnINE&_nc_oc=Ado9iik5AKBgfXMRhrXWy4EaMW0QYL5q1TmT02J5Phaow4KJB-fnvSefeevNniCUVlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQwvHmEDc9M892mQLUscEKHraq9OlH3jDGtOhQ3Q11d8g&oe=6AFDD1F3"}, "is_concept": false, 